 You can find out more about all these settings in the [Rails Action Mailer documentation](https://guides.rubyonrails.org/action_mailer_basics.html#action-mailer-configuration).
 
+#### Push notifications
+
+Fizzy can send web push notifications to phones and desktops, but this needs a VAPID key pair to sign the messages.
+If you don't set one, Fizzy works normally but people can't turn on notifications for their devices.
+
+You can generate a key pair by running:
+
+```sh
+bin/rails runner 'key = WebPush.generate_key; puts "VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=#{key.public_key}"; puts "VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=#{key.private_key}"'
